    "text": "# Allow catalog_controller to use catalog_repository directly\n\n* Status: Superseded by ADR-040\n* Date: 2025-06-07\n\n## Context and Problem Statement\n\nThe layering rule R005 normally forbids this dependency, but reporting queries need a consistent read snapshot.\n\n## Decision Outcome\n\nThe catalog controller (`catalog_controller`) is permitted to access the catalog repository (`catalog_repository`) directly. This is a deliberate, permanent exception to rule R005.\n\n### Consequences\n\nNo other module is covered by this exception.\n",
